{"id":"bbcffe58bd665fe7a39df343d3f444285f719e43","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1246312","title":"[开源] 我把《杀戮尖塔 2》移植到了网页端","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"moonrailgun","excerpt":"分享创造 - @moonrailgun - 花了点时间用 AI 把杀戮尖塔 2 移植到了网页版。方便随时随地来一盘。AI 做这些事情还是非常厉害的，之前在社区里面也有看到用 AI 去逆向老的红警，还有魔兽。想着杀戮尖塔 2 已经有这么多","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/网页版\"><li></li> 网页版</a><a href=\"/tag/移植\"><li></li> 移植</a><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a></P><p><span>12 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-04 16:27:45 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147016\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/40eaa45a823f075189ca2a4f76343678?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jackOff\" data-uid=\"593397\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jackOff\">jackOff</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 23:32:26 +08:00\">21h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>感谢，我用手机玩这玩意总是容易发烫，这下子可以挂电脑，手机访问玩了！</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147170\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fe53/517d/36358_normal.png?m=1488129252\" alt=\"Perry\" data-uid=\"36358\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Perry\">Perry</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 05:37:58 +0